WEBVTT

00:10:28.831 --> 00:10:30.990
mencegah pertambahan berat

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:34.213
bukannya menurunkan berat.

00:10:34.213 --> 00:10:35.749
Sedarlah:

00:10:35.749 --> 00:10:39.960
Jika berdiet berkesan, 
kita semua sudah kurus.

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:41.860
(Gelak ketawa)

00:10:41.860 --> 00:10:43.497
Kenapa kita masih buat benda sama

00:10:43.497 --> 00:10:46.380
dan harapkan kesan yang berlainan?

00:10:46.380 --> 00:10:48.063
Mungkin berdiet nampaknya tidak bahaya,

00:10:48.063 --> 00:10:51.781
tapi sebenarnya memberi 
banyak kesan sampingan.

00:10:51.781 --> 00:10:54.216
Paling teruk, 
ia merosakkan kehidupan:

00:10:54.216 --> 00:10:56.532
Obsesi berat mendorong 
kepada kecelaruan makan,

00:10:56.532 --> 00:10:59.475
terutamanya dalam kalangan 
kanak-kanak muda.

00:10:59.475 --> 00:11:04.353
Di Amerika, 80% budak perempuan 
berumur 10 tahun